==Trivia==
* In both seasons with the activation phrases, the [[Hidden Immunity Idol]]s were activated on Day 11.
* [[Brad Reese]] is the first contestant to open multiple Beware Advantages.
** [[Drea Wheeler]] is the first contestant to activate multiple Beware Advantages.
* [[Randen Montalvo]] is the first (and so far, only) contestant to be [[Evacuation|evacuated]] while having a Beware Advantage in his possession.
* In the ''On Fire with Jeff Probst'' podcast, [[Jeff Probst]] revealed that the name "Beware Advantage" came before a concept for the advantage was established.<ref>https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/advantages-and-idols/id1673596832?i=1000603381228 (21:00)</ref><ref>https://twitter.com/survivorcbs/status/1633663900846800897</ref>

